{"id": "DbvIz5iRf_M", "title": "Video by _k.elsie", "description": "🚤Main channel views of Lake Hickory. Golf course behind you. One of the finest lots in Oliver’s Landing.📣\n\nSited on nearly half an acre with open water out front and the fairways of Players Ridge tucked behind the treeline, this is a setting that simply cannot be recreated. Location alone places this property among the best in the neighborhood.\nWhat you get:\n\n🏡 All brick two story home\n🛏️ 5 bedrooms, 3.5 baths\n⭐ Primary suite AND laundry on the main level\n🔥 Fireplace anchoring the living room\n🔥 Back patio with a custom built-in fire pit\n🌿 Fenced backyard with privacy and room to enjoy\n💧 Main channel views of Lake Hickory\n⛳ Golf course backdrop\n💰 No city taxes\n\nOliver’s Landing sits along the northern shoreline of Lake Hickory just off Highway 127, close enough to town to make daily life easy while still feeling like a retreat. Publix at Lake Hickory Crossings, Food Lion on North Center Street, and Lowes Foods in Viewmont are all roughly ten minutes away. Downtown Hickory and Union Square with its boutique shopping, local restaurants, and year round events is about fifteen. And because the community sits just outside the city limits in Alexander County, there are no city taxes.\nCommunity amenities include:\n\n⛳ Players Ridge Golf Club\n🍽️ Clubhouse with on site dining\n🚤 Community boat ramp\n⚓ Two community boat slips\n\nPicture it. Friends gathered around the fire pit on a cool fall evening. Coffee on the patio while the water catches the morning light. This is the kind of home where life slows down and memories get made.\nProperties positioned like this one rarely come available.\n\n💬 Comment OLIVERS LANDING and I will send you the full details.\n\nOFFERED AT $795,000 \n\nCUSTOM PROPRTY WEBSITE 🔗 \nhttps://1025-n-shore-drive.kelsieblevinsrealestate.com/\n\nKelsie Blevins Realtor | Realty Executives of Hickory & Lake Norman\n828.221.6070\nYour Property Deserves The Investment\n\n#fyp #foryou #foryoupage #realtor #top", "channel": "_k.elsie", "uploader_id": "293006440", "uploader": "Kelsie Blevins | REALTOR®️", "timestamp": 1786100823, "like_count": 17708, "comment_count": 242, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1359239982442958a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 69.995, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNzzEikXV8MxggDG6S1ubW63AOhshExVaVRlWGRs4JWWzuhyfZcSSRwp2mu-_7Z8czxirUUljEjuokR_NcW42myncP9YKHVpswTDK0.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=xDgn1B_Fk_MQ7kNvwE01kss&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=FsxAZZN-AgS_s1R5uhQxcQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQPbj9-pbKoIeXLY0OT2JvFZJ-NDX3yWutCtaunNWfMkLg&oe=6ADEF6D3", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 69.995, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1359239982442958a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPXLLZnZpr0Q84myJfgozcWmCTOb6ZC4fSEkBsEd0nZzdi0617NgefGCn33fIjSLgFL98TMqPXS2nHX2IfLN1lssLXSKiivQNNDPRk.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=fudRlME-zKYQ7kNvwGHiu7u&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9n